-         Error `↯/s.72.1`, _the DAG operation failed because `reason`_, with the reason numbered within
-         it. `Reason.Cyclic` (191.2, _the graph contains a cycle_) is raised by the checking
-         factories `Dag(…)`, by `acyclic` on any graph, by `Dag#add` for an edge whose target
-         already reaches its source, and by `Topology#add` likewise; the graph being edited is left
-         unchanged. `Reason.NodeMissing(node)` (191.1, _the node `node` is not present in the
-         graph_) is raised by `reachable`, `descendants`, `ancestors` and `lineage` for a node the
-         graph does not have — on a `Dag`, a `Digraph` and through the generic extension alike —
-         with the node rendered by its `toString`.
+         Error `↯/s.72.1`, _the DAG operation failed because `reason`_, con el motivo numerado
+         dentro de él. `Reason.Cyclic` (191.2, _the graph contains a cycle_) lo lanzan las
+         factorías comprobadas `Dag(…)`, `acyclic` sobre cualquier grafo, `Dag#add` para una
+         arista cuyo destino ya alcanza su origen, y del mismo modo `Topology#add`; el grafo que
+         se está editando no cambia. `Reason.NodeMissing(node)` (191.1, _the node `node` is not
+         present in the graph_) lo lanzan `reachable`, `descendants`, `ancestors` y `lineage`
+         para un nodo que el grafo no tiene —en un `Dag`, en un `Digraph` y a través de la
+         extensión genérica por igual—, con el nodo representado mediante su `toString`.

